\pard\nowidctlpar\li284\sl276\slmult1\fs21 This instructional program class comprises any program that prepares individuals to apply mathematical and scientific principles to the design, development and operational evaluation of electrical, electronic and related communications systems and their components, including electrical power generation systems; and the analysis of problems such as superconductor, wave propagation, energy storage and retrieval, and reception and amplification.\par\pard\nowidctlpar\slmult1\fs24\par\b SKILLS\b0\fs4\par\sa200\tlul\tx9088\tab\par\pard\nowidctlpar\li284\sl276\slmult1\fs21 Programming languages: Java and C++ Computer software/ frameworks: Microsoft Office adobe java script AutoCAD, Languages: English fluent, Spanish intermediate\par\pard\nowidctlpar\slmult1\fs24\par\b WORK EXPERIENCE\b0\fs4\par\sa200\tlul\tx9088\tab\par\pard\nowidctlpar\sl240\slmult1\tqr\tx9088\fs21 
\b
Costumer Service Assistant
\b0
\tab Sep 2025 - Dec 2025\par\n\pard\nowidctlpar\sl240\slmult1\cf1 Teds Kitchen 
\bullet
 
Toronto, Ontario\cf0\tab\par\pard\par
\pard{\pntext\f1\'95\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf1\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'95}}\fi-284\li568\sl276\slmult1\fs21 Take customers\rquote  orders\par
{\pntext\f1\'95\tab}Use equipment to prepare hot beverages such as coffee and tea specialties\par
{\pntext\f1\'95\tab}Serve customers at counters or buffet tables\par
{\pntext\f1\'95\tab}Stock refrigerators and salad bars and keep records of the quantities of food used\par
{\pntext\f1\'95\tab}May receive payment for food items purchased.\par
{\pntext\f1\'95\tab}Wash work tables, cupboards and appliances\par
{\pntext\f1\'95\tab}Remove trash and clean kitchen garbage containers\par
{\pntext\f1\'95\tab}Unpack and store supplies in refrigerators, cupboards and other storage areas\par
{\pntext\f1\'95\tab}Sweep and mop floors, and perform other duties to assist cook and kitchen staff.\par
{\pntext\f1\'95\tab}Clear and clean tables and trays in eating establishments\par
{\pntext\f1\'95\tab}Bring clean dishes, flatware and other items to serving areas and set tables\par
{\pntext\f1\'95\tab}Replenish condiments and other supplies at tables and in serving areas\par
{\pntext\f1\'95\tab}Remove dishes before and after courses\par
{\pntext\f1\'95\tab}Perform other duties such as scraping and stacking dishes, carrying linen to and from laundry area and running errands.\par
{\pntext\f1\'95\tab}Wash dishes, glassware, flatware, pots and pans using dishwasher or by hand\par
{\pntext\f1\'95\tab}Place dishes in storage area\par
{\pntext\f1\'95\tab}Scour pots and pans, and may clean and polish silverware.\par
\pard\par
\pard\nowidctlpar\sl240\slmult1\tqr\tx9088\fs21 
